---
import RitualExperience from '../../../layouts/RitualExperience.astro';
import RitualStep from '../../../components/ritual-experience/RitualStep.astro';
import VideoPlaceholder from '../../../components/ritual-experience/VideoPlaceholder.astro';
import { ritualExperiences } from '../../../data/ritualExperiences';
---

<RitualExperience
  title="Step Into Your Fire | My Ritual Library"
  description="A private ceremonial journey within the Tarot Flower Ritual Library."
  image={ritualExperiences.fire.image}
>
  <main class="ceremonial-journey" data-ritual-experience data-product-slug="step-into-your-fire">
    <div class="ceremonial-loading" data-ritual-loading>
      <span class="ceremonial-ember" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>Opening the ritual…</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ceremonial-book" data-ritual-content hidden>
      <div class="ceremonial-masthead" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Step Into Your Fire</span>
        <i></i>
        <span class="ceremonial-progress" data-ritual-progress>1 / 6</span>
      </div>

      <RitualStep id="opening" tone="dark" className="ceremonial-opening">
        <img
          class="ceremonial-full-bleed-image"
          src={ritualExperiences.fire.image}
          alt={ritualExperiences.fire.imageAlt}
        />
        <div class="ceremonial-overlay"></div>
        <a class="ceremonial-library-link" href="/library/">My Ritual Library</a>
        <div class="ceremonial-opening-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Welcome</p>
          <h1>Step Into Your Fire</h1>
          <p class="ceremonial-question">Are you ready to ignite your fire?</p>
          <div class="ceremonial-opening-introduction">
            <p>You have already made the hardest decision of all: <strong>you chose yourself.</strong> You chose to invest in yourself, to reclaim your own power, and to step into the fire.</p>
            <p>As we move through this ritual together, remember that there is no right or wrong way to practice a ritual. I'm sharing with you the way I practice my rituals, but you already know how to practice magic. Listen to your own soul. Listen to your intuition. Give yourself permission to dive deep.</p>
            <p><strong>All feelings are messengers.</strong> The dark, painful, and scary feelings have as much value as the beautiful ones. If shame comes up, acknowledge it. Hold it, respect it, honor it, and release it. If fear comes up, take note. Write it in your journal. Listen to what it has to tell you.</p>
            <p>Nobody is watching you. <strong>It's just you and me in this room.</strong> You and your Goddess Guide. Your connection to the divine.</p>
            <p>If you feel inspired to do something completely different, do it. This isn't a formula. This isn't a prescription. Listen to yourself and follow what arises.</p>
            <p>I'm just sharing my way with you, so that you can find yours.</p>
            <p><strong>Let's ignite the fire - our inner fire.</strong></p>
          </div>
          <button class="ceremonial-button ceremonial-button-light" type="button" data-ritual-next>Begin</button>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <RitualStep id="initiation" tone="dark" className="ceremonial-threshold-page">
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-art">
          <img src="/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire/fire-goddess-front-flipped.jpg" alt="Fire goddess oracle artwork" />
        </div>
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Initiation</p>
          <h2>Initiation</h2>
          <p class="ceremonial-invocation">I Choose</p>
          <p>Enter the ritual and choose the intention you are ready to carry forward.</p>
          <VideoPlaceholder
            label="Initiation ritual"
            src="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/video-initiation"
          />
          <button class="ceremonial-button ceremonial-button-light" type="button" data-ritual-next>Move into Destruction</button>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <RitualStep id="destruction" tone="dark" className="ceremonial-threshold-page ceremonial-threshold-reverse">
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-art">
          <img src="/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire/burn-oracle-card-crisp.png" alt="Burn oracle card" />
        </div>
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Destruction</p>
          <h2>Destruction</h2>
          <p class="ceremonial-invocation">I Release</p>
          <p>Meet what is ready to be released and offer it to the fire.</p>
          <VideoPlaceholder
            label="Destruction ritual"
            src="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/video-destruction"
          />
          <button class="ceremonial-button ceremonial-button-light" type="button" data-ritual-next>Begin the Embodiment</button>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <RitualStep id="guardian" tone="dark" className="ceremonial-threshold-page">
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-art">
          <img src="/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire/guardian-oracle-card.png" alt="Guardian oracle card" />
        </div>
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Guardian</p>
          <h2>Guardian</h2>
          <p class="ceremonial-invocation">I Embody</p>
          <p>Rise into the body and embody the energy you are ready to claim.</p>
          <VideoPlaceholder
            label="Guardian embodiment ritual"
            src="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/video-guardian"
          />
          <button class="ceremonial-button ceremonial-button-light" type="button" data-ritual-next>Receive</button>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <RitualStep id="freedom" tone="dark" className="ceremonial-threshold-page ceremonial-threshold-reverse">
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-art">
          <img src="/images/digital-rituals/step-into-the-fire/freedom-oracle-card.png" alt="Freedom oracle card" />
        </div>
        <div class="ceremonial-threshold-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Freedom</p>
          <h2>Freedom</h2>
          <p class="ceremonial-invocation">I Receive</p>
          <p>Become still and receive the sound bath.</p>
          <VideoPlaceholder
            label="Freedom sound bath"
            quiet={true}
            src="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/video-freedom"
          />
          <button class="ceremonial-button ceremonial-button-light" type="button" data-ritual-next>Receive the Closing Blessing</button>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <RitualStep id="closing" tone="light" className="ceremonial-closing-page">
        <div class="ceremonial-closing-copy">
          <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Closing Blessing</p>
          <h2>Blessing</h2>
          <p class="ceremonial-journal-invitation">Take a few quiet moments to journal what you chose, released, embodied, and received.</p>
          <p class="ceremonial-blessing">
            I left my shadow behind at the altar of destruction.<br />
            It burned away to make space for the light.<br />
            And I grow my fire, my flame, my guardian.<br />
            I am my guardian.<br />
            I stand tall, I stand proud.<br />
            I am, I walk, I fight, I guide, I burn, I bring the light.<br />
            Charge forward with your light.<br />
            Leave the ashes behind.<br />
            Rise up and shine.<br />
            The ancient remembrance be your guide.<br />
            You rise.<br />
            You are between worlds.<br />
            You walk between worlds.<br />
            You walk, you fly.
          </p>
          <div class="ceremonial-circle-guidance">
            <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Open the Circle</p>
            <p>When you are ready, slowly walk the circle three times in reverse, opening the sacred space and returning its energy to the world.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ceremonial-companions-placeholder" aria-label="Companion downloads">
            <p>Companion Downloads</p>
            <a href="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/guide?download=1">Ritual Guide</a>
            <a href="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/music?download=1">Original Music</a>
            <a href="/api/library/files/step-into-your-fire/movement?download=1">Movement Practice</a>
          </div>
          <a class="ceremonial-button" href="/library/">Return to My Rituals</a>
        </div>
      </RitualStep>

      <button class="ceremonial-previous" type="button" data-ritual-previous hidden aria-label="Return to the previous ritual page">
        <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Return
      </button>
    </div>

    <section class="ceremonial-access-error" hidden data-ritual-error>
      <p class="ceremonial-eyebrow">Private ritual</p>
      <h1>This ritual isn’t available in the current library session.</h1>
      <a class="ceremonial-button" href="/library/login/">Email My Magic Link</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/scripts/ritual-library.js" is:inline></script>
</RitualExperience>
